# `private_class_method` handed an array or a splat of `%i[…]`; `private :x`
# after `def x` (and in `class << self`, for a class method); an alias,
# which takes its original's visibility at alias time, not its section's
# (`mode?` stays public under `private`, `inner2` is private under
# `public`); and a `define_method` in a `private` section (DEC-561).
